  function renameTrackLine(keyValue,name){if(!canNetworkEdit()){toast('主机暂时关闭了轨道编辑权限');return;}const line=trackNetworks().find(v=>v.key===Number(keyValue));if(!line)return;const clean=String(name||'').trim().slice(0,18);for(const t of line.pieces)t.lineName=clean;trackNetworkCache=null;saveGame();updateTrackPanel();toast(clean?`线路已命名为“${clean}”`:'线路名称已恢复为自动编号');}
